        "serial": "i5ec7d8d84b92d",
        "body": "<div class=\"grid-row\"><div class=\"col-12\"> <h1>Extended Text with Math Entry<\/h1> <\/div><\/div> <div class=\"grid-row\"><div class=\"col-12\"> <p> Given the following formula for standard deviation:<\/p> <p>{{math_5e5e7a713e1cf077548790}}<\/p> <p>derive a formula for the sample size <em>N<\/em> in terms of the mean <em>&mu;<\/em> and values <em>&#119909;<\/em>.<\/p><\/div><\/div> <div class=\"grid-row\"><div class=\"col-12\"> {{i5ec7d8d84baa2}}<\/div><\/div>",
